                                 },
                          "en":  {
                                     "title":  "POS Performance Boost, Smart Delta Updates \u0026 Cloud Licensing",
                                     "summary":  "Major upgrade introducing differential delta updates, hardware-bound licensing, and POS barcode acceleration.",
                                     "highlights":  [
